flowchart TD
    M[main start: readConfig / parseDuration / withAsyncLock] --> D[dispatchOnce: assertRepo → fetchIssues]
    D --> C[chooseIssue input]
    C -->|dispatch| P[writeAtomic intent → call Paseo]
    C -->|idle or busy| N[不派工]
    P --> W[jsonOut result / 等待 interval]
    N --> W
    W -->|running=true| D
    W -->|false| S[釋放 owner.lock / 停止]
